Package: ISPAT3D
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Network Estimation in 3D Multiplexed Cancer Imaging
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Sagnik", "Bhadury", email = "bhadury@umich.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates conditional cell-density associations in registered
    volumetric multiplex imaging. The legacy API retains exact type-II
    Gaussian-process fitting and variational multi-study factor analysis
    for smaller inputs. The documented revision scripts use a scalable
    Vecchia Gaussian-process approximation and fit the same shared-plus-zone
    factor covariance form from full adjusted covariance summaries.
